 "text": "Hey! How's everything going? Lots of people do. You can set up a small office table and a laptop, and take breaks to stretch. Then make sure to take proper breaks, and maybe stand up while you' online a bit. A standing desk is very cheap and roomy. Then use it as your primary desk for a morning, or switch between it and the regular desk. Change is good for your body. Sit on an adjustable chair with a cushion under your bottom. A small pillow between your shoulder blade and the chair back can help too.",
